  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A) Given</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>(B) for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br />Which is not possible because LHS <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &amp; RHS <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>from LMVT, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>'</mo></msubsup><mfenced><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced></math> for atleast one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>(D) Given</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>for</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;So, increasing in this interval.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>for</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;So, decreasing in this interval.</p>",
